n=14 / n=18 LRC Tournament Analysis ping-pong (codex-2026-06-01 S481)
All LRC interval and endpoint computations are exact over Fraction.

========================================================================================================
DETERMINISTIC FORCED-RANDOMNESS CARDS
========================================================================================================
Seed 481.  These are not evidence; they decide what to test next.
1. Bruhat-Tits frontier: shrinking the real gap should push endpoint mass deeper, not erase it
2. two-neighbor braid: the nearest runner alone is a projection of a left/right handoff pair
3. SC blowup: first-even rows create a twin sheet that hides inherited unit data
4. basketball tie path: arbitrary labels are still a Hamiltonian path and should be declared

